{"id":"b6ec5105268243bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-mostowski.md","title":"Mostowski Collapse","display":"df-mostowski — Mostowski Collapse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mostowski","aliases":["58-df-mostowski","Mostowski Collapse"],"display":"df-mostowski — Mostowski Collapse","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[58-df-wellfounded]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mostowski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mostowski</span><span>Mostowski Collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mostowski — Mostowski Collapse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,R,M,\\pi\\in V\">\\(A,R,M,\\pi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> (well-founded-relation predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijection predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\)</span> (Mostowski-collapse relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mostowski} \\vdash \\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land \\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land \\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall z\\in A\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R)\\right]\\to x=y\\right)\\land \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land \\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,A,M)\\land \\forall x,y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\\land \\forall x\\in A\\;\\pi(x)=\\{\\pi(y)\\mid y\\in A\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mostowski} \\vdash \\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land \\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land \\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall z\\in A\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R)\\right]\\to x=y\\right)\\land \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land \\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,A,M)\\land \\forall x,y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\\land \\forall x\\in A\\;\\pi(x)=\\{\\pi(y)\\mid y\\in A\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For every well-founded extensional relation on a set, the collapse target and collapse map are unique; uniqueness is a theorem about the relation above, not a unary property of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The last conjunct is the recursive collapse equation.</li>\n<li>Used in inner model theory: collapse of premice to mice; iteration strategy</li>\n<li>Reflection: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> are transitive; define mouse from iteration tree</li>\n<li>Mouse: self-wellorderable transitive set; core model iteration produces mice</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Steel, The Core Model Iterability Problem</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wellfounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (well-founded-relation predicate; see [[58-df-wellfounded]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S$ (transitive-set predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (bijection predicate; see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,R,M,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mostowski} \\vdash \\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land \\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land \\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall z\\in A\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R)\\right]\\to x=y\\right)\\land \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land \\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,A,M)\\land \\forall x,y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\\land \\forall x\\in A\\;\\pi(x)=\\{\\pi(y)\\mid y\\in A\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1801,"backlinks":[{"id":"76513f0990e969ba","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-mostowski]])"},{"id":"5e1b548bf29939ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-mostowski]])"},{"id":"37a3e43a3599a849","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dfcd8a7128928cfb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a6e71df24b1693f5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)$ is the exact collapse relation (see [[58-df-mostowski]])"},{"id":"1eb3d35bc0d015a8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)$ is the exact collapse relation from [[58-df-mostowski]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-864","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-mostowski.md|58-df-mostowski]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["c14ba496c480dcd6","7308daa58e0345ed","d583890235faf0d5"]}